# Cover sibling build trees too (build-unify-check/, build-unify-test/, ...) so
# a CI step reproduced locally cannot be committed by accident. Anchored with a
# leading slash: unanchored, "build*/" matches at ANY depth and would swallow
# the tracked Tests/build_sanity_tests/ suite, silently hiding new files there.
/build*/
